<title>USA: Computer Horizons wins $9.3 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Computer Horizons wins $9.3 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN LAKES, N.J. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Horizons Corp said Wednesday it won a $9.3 million Year 2000 contract from the Lutheran Brotherhood, an insurance and financial services company based in Minneapolis.</p>
<p>Computer Horizons said the contract covers the construction phase of the project to renovate Lutheran Brotherhood's applications over a two-year period so that the company's computer systems will be able to make the transition to the new millenium.</p>
</text>
